{
  "schema": "oriveo.search.settings/v1",
  "$comment": "Settings page presentation rules: add-sheet grouping, list row states, price summary, default service, consent sentence, test results and form field hints. Entries are always referenced by serviceId into search_catalog_contract.v1.json#catalog.services (tests on all platforms read that file too). Expectations come from the reference implementation of the settings rules (external search service contract, section 11a).",
